+| `q8_0` KV / draft KV | 23.6 | slower |
+| `f16` KV / draft KV | 24.6 | slower |
+| `--swa-full` | 27.6 | no improvement after MMVQ tune |
+| `--no-host` | 26.2 | no improvement |
