+- ROCm/HIP RDNA3.5 `MUL_MAT_ID` routing now has a ROCmFP4-only compile-time
+  guard knob, `GGML_ROCMFP4_RDNA35_MMID_MAX_BATCH`, for testing whether MTP/MoE
